Description: Parallel Linear Algebra Software for Multicore Architectures (gnu15, OpenHPC)
 PLASMA is a software package for solving problems in dense linear algebra
 using multicore processors. It provides parallel implementations of LAPACK
 routines leveraging task-based parallelism.
 Built with the gnu15 compiler family.
 .
 This package is part of the OpenHPC project.
